Magic Resistance > Reflection.

Reflection offers complete protection from all rays, but most players
reach a point where rays aren't that dangerous damage-wise, and magic
resistance reduces ray damage.  Reflection protects against death rays,
but magic resistance makes you immune to them.  The really useful
things about reflection is protecting miscellaneous stuff from rays and
protection against disintegration blasts, but both of these things can
be defended against in other ways that don't involve equipment slots.
Meanwhile not having magic resistance will practically always get you
in a bad state when you start encountering polymorph traps (bye-bye
armor), and if not then, when you start facing monsters who can use
Destroy Armor.


